usage: web.py [-h] [--port PORT] [--data-dir DATA_DIR]
              [--model-path MODEL_PATH] [--open] [--legacy] [--recover-names]

Local browser UI for the existing QA models; no extra web dependencies.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT
  --data-dir DATA_DIR   Custom processed data; enables A0 only.
  --model-path MODEL_PATH
                        Custom A0 model.pkl; enables A0 only.
  --open                Open the local UI in your browser.
  --legacy              Use default experiment data and neural models instead
                        of the activated A0 profile.
  --recover-names       Enable auditable name recovery for neural answers.
